00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:45.340
Nobody can get by that female fullback except a woman.

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:47.340
Wait a minute. Roger.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:49.340
I gotta get Ed out of there.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.340
And I think I have an idea.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.340
Come on.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:59.340
Wilbur, I know you love that horse, but I think this scheme of yours is absolutely ridiculous.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.340
I just gotta get my horse out.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.340
